  "prefLabel": "Mavs 304.01 Criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 304.01 Criteria.\n\n(a) Enlistment assistants who refer a non-prior service, prior service, interstate transfer, or inter-service transfer enlistee, shall be eligible to apply for a $500 incentive payment.\n\n(b) Incentive payments shall be made when the enlistee ships to basic combat training for non-prior service enlistees.\n\n(c) Incentive payments shall be made upon the enlistee completing the first MUTA at the enlistee’s assigned unit for prior service enlistees, interstate transfers, and inter-service transfers.\n\n(d) Pay grade of the enlistment assistant shall be determined at the time of the referral.\n\nSource. #13459-B, eff 10-14-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mavs300.html"
